---
/** Shown on the home page until it has content, so a fresh site isn't a blank screen. */
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="container empty">
    <h1 class="section-heading">Your new site is ready</h1>
    <p class="section-intro">Open the CMS, fill in Settings → Business info &amp; hours, then add sections to the Home page.</p>
    <div class="btn-row"><a href="/studio" class="btn btn--primary">Open the CMS</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .empty { max-width: 40rem; text-align: center; }
  .empty .btn-row { justify-content: center; }
</style>
